category: Net
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel libcurl-devel libextractor-devel libgcrypt-devel libgmp-devel libgnutls-devel libidn2-devel libintl-devel libjansson-devel libjose-devel libmicrohttpd-devel libogg-devel libopus-devel libpq-devel libpq5 libpulse-devel libsodium-devel libsqlite3-devel libunistring-devel libzbar-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Framework for distributed, secure and privacy-preserving applications (utilities)"
ldesc: "GNUnet is peer-to-peer framework providing a network abstractions and
applications focusing on security and privacy.  So far, we have
created applications for anonymous file-sharing, decentralized naming
and identity management, decentralized and confidential telephony and
tunneling IP traffic over GNUnet.  GNUnet is currently developed by a
worldwide group of independent free software developers.  GNUnet is a
GNU package (https://www.gnu.org/)."
skip:

homepage: https://www.gnunet.org/en/
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later AND MIT AND 0BSD
